<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Spiral Engine — Neutral Edition</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --c-infrared:#7a0d2b; --c-magenta:#c2338a; --c-red:#d1402f; --c-amber:#e39420;
    --c-orange:#e8692e; --c-green:#5a9c3e; --c-teal:#1f9e83; --c-turquoise:#2bb6c4; --c-purple:#7a5bc7;
    --ink:#22201c; --ink-soft:#5c574e; --ink-faint:#8f897d;
    --paper:#f4f1ea; --panel:#fbfaf6; --line:#e0dccf; --line-strong:#cbc5b4; --accent:#3c6e63;
    --sans:"Inter",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
    --serif:"EB Garamond",Georgia,serif;
    --mono:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);line-height:1.5;padding:1.5rem;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  .wrap{max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto}
  .eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.3rem}
  h1{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .sub{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.92rem;margin-top:.25rem;max-width:660px}

  /* ---- calibration gate ---- */
  #calibration{max-width:620px;margin:2.5rem auto;text-align:center}
  #calibration .q{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.55rem;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:.5rem}
  #calibration .qsub{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.95rem;margin-bottom:2rem;max-width:480px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}
  .densities{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.9rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
  @media(max-width:640px){.densities{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  .density{
    border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:14px;padding:1.1rem 1rem;cursor:pointer;
    background:var(--panel);transition:all .18s;text-align:left;
  }
  .density:hover{border-color:var(--accent);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .density h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:.3rem}
  .density p{font-size:.84rem;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5}
  .density .feel{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--accent);margin-top:.5rem;font-style:italic}
  .calnote{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink-faint);line-height:1.5}

  .introduction{max-width:760px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem;margin:.6rem 0 1.5rem}
  .introduction p{margin:.35rem 0}
  .introduction .intro-lead{color:var(--ink);font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:.6rem}
  .log-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px}
  .log-heading h2{margin-bottom:0}
  .turn-counter{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.76rem;color:var(--ink-soft);white-space:nowrap}
  /* ---- game ---- */
  #game{display:none}
  .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 310px;gap:1.5rem;align-items:start}
  @media(max-width:940px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

  .board-wrap{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:1rem;overflow:auto}
  .phase-banner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.7rem;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .phase-pill{font-family:var(--mono);padding:.2rem .7rem;border-radius:999px;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .phase-pill.inhale{background:rgba(90,156,62,.15);color:#3b6d11}
  .phase-pill.exhale{background:rgba(216,90,48,.15);color:#712b13}

  #board{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:0 auto;width:max-content;grid-auto-flow:row}
  .cell{width:68px;height:42px;border-radius:6px;position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.12);transition:transform .12s,box-shadow .12s;font-size:10px;user-select:none;overflow:hidden}
  .cell.empty{background:transparent;border:none;pointer-events:none}
  .cell.perspective .glyph{font-size:15px;line-height:1}
  .cell.essential{height:88px;box-sizing:border-box;border-width:2px;border-color:rgba(0,0,0,.35);border-radius:10px}
  .cell.essential .enum{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:17px;font-weight:600}
  .cell .catmark{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;line-height:1}
  .cell.perspective{flex-direction:column;gap:1px}
  .cell.perspective .catmark{font-size:10px}
  .cell.essential{flex-direction:column;gap:3px;padding:4px 2px}
  .cell.essential .catid{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px}
  .cell.essential .req{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;opacity:.9;line-height:1.15;text-align:center}
  .cell.center{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .cell.center .spiral{position:absolute;inset:0;background:conic-gradient(from 0deg,#d1402f,#e39420,#5a9c3e,#2bb6c4,#7a5bc7,#c2338a,#d1402f)}
  .cell.center .eye{position:absolute;inset:9px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,#fff,rgba(255,255,255,0) 72%)}
  .cell.center .enum{position:relative;z-index:2;color:#fff;text-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
  .cell.reachable{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:1px;cursor:pointer}
  .cell.reachable:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
  .cell.here{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--ink) inset}
  .cell.destination-open{outline:2px dashed var(--accent);outline-offset:1px}
  .reserved-flag{position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
  .pawn{position:absolute;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #111;background:#fff;color:#000;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:700 12px/1 Inter,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.4);z-index:3}

  .panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:1rem 1.1rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
  .panel h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:.6rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}
  .panel h2 .recal{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--sans);letter-spacing:.02em}
  .players{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}
  .player{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:.55rem .7rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;transition:all .15s}
  .player.active{border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(60,110,99,.06)}
  .player.centered{border-color:#d85a30}
  .player .dot{width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #111;background:#fff;color:#000;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:700 12px/1 Inter,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.2);flex-shrink:0}
  .player .pmeta{flex:1;min-width:0}
  .player .pname{font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem}
  .player .tag{font-size:.65rem;padding:.05rem .4rem;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(216,90,48,.15);color:#712b13;font-weight:600}
  .player .pstat{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--ink-faint)}
  .player .ptokens{margin-top:5px}
  .tokrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px}
  .tok{width:13px;height:13px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
  .tok.empty-slot{background:transparent;border:1px dashed var(--line-strong)}
  .tok.dormant{background:transparent;border:2px dashed;animation:pulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite}
  .tok.gift{border-radius:50%}
  .tokgap{width:7px;display:inline-block}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.5}50%{opacity:1}}
  .handrow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px;margin-top:4px}
  .hcard{min-width:16px;height:20px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.18);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;padding:0 2px}
  .hcard sub{font-size:8px;margin-left:1px}
  .pspiral.done{animation:draw 1.1s ease both}
  @keyframes draw{from{opacity:0;transform:rotate(-40deg) scale(.7)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .player.won{border-color:var(--accent);background:rgba(60,110,99,.08)}

  .controls{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.55rem}
  .die{width:100%;padding:.7rem;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:var(--panel);
    font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;color:var(--ink)}
  .die:hover:not(:disabled){border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent)}
  .die:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
  .die .num{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.3rem;margin-left:.4rem}
  .hint{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5}
  .hint b{color:var(--ink)}

  .action{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:.9rem 1rem;margin-top:.6rem;background:var(--panel);display:none}
  .action.show{display:block;animation:rise .3s ease both}
  @keyframes rise{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .action.win{border:2px solid var(--accent);background:rgba(60,110,99,.08);text-align:center}
  .rcolor{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:6px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
  .rq{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1rem;margin:.5rem 0;color:var(--ink)}
  .rmeta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.76rem;color:var(--ink-faint);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}
  .btn{margin-top:.6rem;padding:.5rem 1rem;border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--accent);background:var(--accent);color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:.88rem;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--sans)}
  .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink-soft);border-color:var(--line-strong)}
  .btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
  select.giftsel{width:100%;margin-top:.5rem;padding:.45rem;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.85rem}

  .log{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:.4rem;max-height:120px;overflow:auto;line-height:1.6}
  .log div{padding:1px 0}
  .note{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--ink-faint);margin-top:.75rem;line-height:1.5;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:.6rem}
  .legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:.6rem}
  .legend span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px}
  .legend .lg{font-size:14px}

/* Edition theme: presentation only; gameplay is shared. */

  :root{
    --ink:#292725;--ink-soft:#60584f;--ink-faint:#81786e;
    --paper:#f4f1ea;--panel:#fbfaf6;--line:#e0dccf;--line-strong:#cbc5b4;--accent:#6e5e53;
  }
  .cell.center .spiral{background:var(--ink)}
  .cell.center .eye{background:radial-gradient(circle,#fbfaf6,rgba(251,250,246,0) 72%)}
  .phase-pill.inhale{background:rgba(141,119,101,.15);color:#605044}
  .phase-pill.exhale{background:rgba(78,70,64,.15);color:#4e4640}
  .player.centered{border-color:#8d7765}
  .player .tag{background:rgba(141,119,101,.15);color:#605044}

  .game-rules{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1rem;max-width:1080px}
  .game-rules h2{margin:0 0 .55rem;font-family:var(--serif)}
  .game-rules p{font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.55;margin:.45rem 0;color:var(--ink-soft)}
  .spectrum-key{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px 9px;align-items:center;width:100%;margin-top:5px}
  .spectrum-entry{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px}
  .spectrum-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:5px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.15)}

/* Website-aligned visual refinement — CSS only; rules and game logic unchanged. */
:root{
  --paper:#f4f1ea;
  --panel:#f8f5ee;
  --line:#ddd7ca;
  --line-strong:#c8c0b2;
  --ink:#292725;
  --ink-soft:#60584f;
  --ink-faint:#81786e;
  --accent:#6e5e53;
  --radius-card:12px;
  --radius-control:8px;
}
html{background:var(--paper)}
body{background:var(--paper);line-height:1.58;padding:clamp(1rem,2.8vw,2.5rem);font-size:14px}
.wrap{max-width:1380px}
.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-bottom:.6rem}
h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,3vw,2.7rem);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.025em}
.sub,.introduction{line-height:1.7}
.introduction{margin:1rem 0 2rem;max-width:720px}
.introduction p{margin:.55rem 0}
.introduction .intro-lead{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1.35;margin-bottom:.75rem}
#calibration{margin:2rem auto 3rem}
#calibration .q{font-size:1.7rem;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:.75rem}
#calibration .qsub{line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.75rem}
.densities{gap:12px}
.density{border-radius:var(--radius-card);padding:1.2rem;box-shadow:none}
.density:hover{transform:none}
.density h3{font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.density p{line-height:1.6}
.layout{gap:1.25rem}
.board-wrap,.panel,.game-rules{border-radius:var(--radius-card);box-shadow:none}
.board-wrap{padding:clamp(.75rem,1.6vw,1.3rem)}
.panel{padding:1.1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:.85rem}
.panel h2,.game-rules h2{font-size:1.22rem;line-height:1.25;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.game-rules{padding:1.25rem 1.4rem;margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.game-rules p{line-height:1.7;margin:.65rem 0}
.player{border-radius:var(--radius-control);padding:.7rem .75rem}
.player .pstat{line-height:1.5}
.die,.action{border-radius:var(--radius-control)}
.die{padding:.8rem 1rem}
.action{padding:1rem}
.btn,select.giftsel{border-radius:var(--radius-control)}
.btn{padding:.65rem 1.1rem}
.hint,.note{line-height:1.65}
.log{line-height:1.7}
.cell{border-radius:5px}
.cell.essential{border-radius:8px}
.phase-pill,.player .tag{border-radius:999px}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:640px){
  body{padding:1rem}
  .introduction{margin-bottom:1.4rem}
  .game-rules{padding:1rem}
  .panel{padding:1rem}
}


/* Neutral three-page presentation and board breathing room */
.flow-page{max-width:100%}
.flow-kicker{font:500 10px/1.5 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink-faint);margin:0 0 1.15rem}
#welcome{max-width:920px;margin:2rem auto 4rem}
#welcome .introduction{max-width:740px}
.welcome-actions,.settings-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:1.4rem 0}
.primary-cta{margin-top:0;padding:.85rem 1.3rem}
.settings-actions{justify-content:space-between;margin:1.3rem 0}
#calibration{max-width:720px;text-align:left}
#calibration .q,#calibration .qsub{margin-left:0;margin-right:0}
#calibration .q{font-size:2rem}
#calibration .qsub{max-width:600px}
.density.selected{border-color:var(--ink);background:var(--panel);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--ink)}
.density:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:3px}
.density.selected h3::after{content:" ✓";font:500 .85rem var(--mono)}
.game-topline{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin:1rem 0}
.game-topline .flow-kicker{margin:0}
.text-control{border:0;background:none;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;font:500 .8rem var(--sans);color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:pointer}
.rules-disclosure{margin:1rem 0 1.25rem}
.rules-disclosure summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.88rem;font-weight:600;padding:.65rem 0}
.rules-disclosure .game-rules{margin-top:.75rem}
.welcome-rules{margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:.75rem}
#board{gap:8px}
.board-wrap{padding:clamp(1rem,2vw,1.65rem)}
@media(max-width:680px){
  #board{gap:6px}
  .board-wrap{padding:.8rem}
  #welcome{margin:1rem auto 3rem}
}

/* Fine orientation grid: presentation only, behind the existing board. */
.board-wrap{
  background-color:var(--paper);
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(to right, rgba(93,85,72,.075) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(93,85,72,.075) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size:20px 20px;
  background-position:0 0;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="eyebrow">Spiral Engine / Neutral Edition</div>
  <h1>The Spiral Engine</h1>
  <!-- WELCOME -->
  <section id="welcome" class="flow-page" aria-label="Welcome">
    <div class="flow-kicker">01 / Welcome</div>
  <div class="introduction">
    <p class="intro-lead"><strong>A strategy game where everyone wins.</strong></p>
    <p>The Spiral Engine is a cooperative strategy game for three players, played across a board of 74 cards.</p>
    <p>Players move through the board, collect cards, complete essentials, and exchange resources. There is one shared winning condition: all three players must complete it together.</p>
    <p>The challenge is finding an effective way to get there. Players can cooperate at their own pace or compare the number of turns different teams take to reach the same outcome.</p>
    <p>The board can also be explored as a strategy puzzle. Its arrangements, relationships, and possible sequences offer plenty to investigate before—or between—games.</p>
    <p>No prior knowledge is needed, and no questions need to be answered to play.</p>
  </div>

    <div class="welcome-actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn primary-cta" id="welcomeNext">Set up the game →</button>
      <span class="hint">Three players · One shared objective</span>
    </div>
    <details class="rules-disclosure welcome-rules">
      <summary>Read the complete rules</summary>
    <section class="game-rules" aria-label="How to play">
      <h2>How to play</h2>
      <p><strong>Shared objective.</strong> Each player must finish with three Level 2 tokens, each containing a Level 1 token, and one additional Level 1 token. Together these represent all six token S-categories. The tokens that require suit cards must be complete. Everyone wins only when all three players meet this condition.</p>
      <p><strong>Suit cards.</strong> The 52 smaller cards carry a suit (♠ ♥ ♣ ♦) and an S-category (S1–S9). Land on an unreserved suit card to reserve it for your hand. A card's <em>suit</em> determines whether it belongs in a required set; its S-category identifies the card independently of its color.</p>
      <p><strong>Essentials.</strong> The 22 numbered larger cards also have S-categories. Each essential specifies an exact set of suits. Without the required resources, it is simply a space you can land on. Each essential can be completed once.</p>
      <p><strong>Level 1 token.</strong> Complete a Level 1 essential while holding its required four suit cards. These cards are associated with that token.</p>
      <p><strong>Level 2 token.</strong> Complete a Level 2 essential using the specified Level 1 token and two additional suit cards of the required suits. The Level 1 token remains part of Level 2. Its original four suit cards are available to use again. This works identically in every play mode.</p>
      <p><strong>Giving.</strong> Once a player has the exact complete set, they must reach the center by ordinary movement to enter giving status. They can then give resources by landing on one of their own reserved spaces. Give either a suit card <em>or</em> a token to another player. Giving a token leaves its associated suit cards with the giver, who can distribute them separately. The recipient must obtain the required suits for that token to count as complete. A given reserve transfers to the recipient. If the giver loses their complete set, they return to gathering and must complete the set and revisit the center to give again.</p>
      <p><strong>Turns.</strong> Roll the six-sided die, then choose a highlighted legal space. Your selected mode controls how much movement freedom and board information is shown. The table log counts the team's completed turns.</p>
    </section>
    </details>
  </section>

  <!-- CALIBRATION -->
  <div id="calibration" class="flow-page" style="display:none">
    <div class="flow-kicker">02 / Settings</div>
    <div class="q">Choose a play mode</div>
    <div class="qsub">Select how movement and guidance work. Each mode uses the same cards and shared winning condition.</div>
    <div class="panel" style="text-align:left;margin-bottom:1rem">
  <h2>Mathematical illumination</h2>
  <label style="display:block;margin:.4rem 0"><input type="radio" name="illumination" value="off" checked> Off — play without the ideal indicator</label>
  <label style="display:block;margin:.4rem 0"><input type="radio" name="illumination" value="on"> On — show distance from the two balanced endings</label>
  <p class="hint">Illumination is information only. It never changes the rules, moves, or victory.</p>
</div>
<div class="densities" id="densities"></div>
    <div class="settings-actions">
      <button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="settingsBack">← Back</button>
      <button type="button" class="btn primary-cta" id="settingsStart">Start game →</button>
    </div>
    <div class="calnote">Both settings can be changed during play without resetting progress.</div>
  </div>

  <!-- GAME -->
  <div id="game" class="flow-page">
    <div class="game-topline"><span class="flow-kicker">03 / Game table</span><button type="button" class="text-control" id="gameSettings">Adjust settings</button></div>
    <details class="rules-disclosure"><summary>How to play · rules reference</summary>
    <section class="game-rules" aria-label="How to play">
      <h2>How to play</h2>
      <p><strong>Shared objective.</strong> Each player must finish with three Level 2 tokens, each containing a Level 1 token, and one additional Level 1 token. Together these represent all six token S-categories. The tokens that require suit cards must be complete. Everyone wins only when all three players meet this condition.</p>
      <p><strong>Suit cards.</strong> The 52 smaller cards carry a suit (♠ ♥ ♣ ♦) and an S-category (S1–S9). Land on an unreserved suit card to reserve it for your hand. A card's <em>suit</em> determines whether it belongs in a required set; its S-category identifies the card independently of its color.</p>
      <p><strong>Essentials.</strong> The 22 numbered larger cards also have S-categories. Each essential specifies an exact set of suits. Without the required resources, it is simply a space you can land on. Each essential can be completed once.</p>
      <p><strong>Level 1 token.</strong> Complete a Level 1 essential while holding its required four suit cards. These cards are associated with that token.</p>
      <p><strong>Level 2 token.</strong> Complete a Level 2 essential using the specified Level 1 token and two additional suit cards of the required suits. The Level 1 token remains part of Level 2. Its original four suit cards are available to use again. This works identically in every play mode.</p>
      <p><strong>Giving.</strong> Once a player has the exact complete set, they must reach the center by ordinary movement to enter giving status. They can then give resources by landing on one of their own reserved spaces. Give either a suit card <em>or</em> a token to another player. Giving a token leaves its associated suit cards with the giver, who can distribute them separately. The recipient must obtain the required suits for that token to count as complete. A given reserve transfers to the recipient. If the giver loses their complete set, they return to gathering and must complete the set and revisit the center to give again.</p>
      <p><strong>Turns.</strong> Roll the six-sided die, then choose a highlighted legal space. Your selected mode controls how much movement freedom and board information is shown. The table log counts the team's completed turns.</p>
    </section>
